<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Richter Digital — Vorschau Hero + Intro</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Raleway:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{--ink:#141414;--paper:#FDFDFD;--accent:#0711ff;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:#141414;background:#141414}
  h1,h2{font-family:'Raleway',sans-serif}
  header{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;height:88px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:transparent}
  .nav-inner{width:100%;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-family:'Raleway';font-weight:700;font-size:21px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
  .logo img{width:42px;height:42px;object-fit:contain;display:block}
  .nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:38px}
  .nav-links a{font-family:'Raleway';font-size:15px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;opacity:.92}
  .navright{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px}
  .lang{font-family:'Raleway';font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#fff}.lang .off{color:rgba(255,255,255,.35)}
  .cta-pill{font-family:'Raleway';font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#fff;background:var(--accent);border-radius:100px;padding:13px 28px;text-decoration:none}

  .hero{position:relative;min-height:100vh;background:var(--ink);overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center}
  .hero video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;z-index:1}
  .hero .overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(20,20,20,0) 0%,rgba(20,20,20,0) 60%,rgba(20,20,20,.8) 100%)}
  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:3;width:100%;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px 48px;text-align:center}
  .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
  .btn-primary{font-family:'Raleway';font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:#fff;background:var(--accent);border-radius:100px;padding:14px 28px;text-decoration:none}
  .btn-ghost{font-family:'Raleway';font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:#fff;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);border-radius:100px;padding:14px 24px;text-decoration:none}

  .intro{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);padding:110px 24px;text-align:center}
  .intro .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto}
  .intro h2{font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,56px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .intro h2 .hl{color:var(--accent)}
  .intro p{margin:20px auto 0;font-family:'Inter';font-size:clamp(16px,1.5vw,20px);line-height:1.55;color:rgba(20,20,20,.7);max-width:58ch}
  .note{background:#EEEEEE;color:#6b6b6b;font-size:13px;padding:16px 40px;text-align:center}
  @media(max-width:900px){.nav-links{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="#" class="logo"><img src="images/logo.png" alt="Richter Digital" /> Richter Digital</a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#">Leistungen ▾</a><a href="#">Portfolio</a><a href="#">Über mich</a><a href="#">Kontakt</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="navright">
        <span class="lang"><b>DE</b><span class="off"> / EN</span></span>
        <a href="#" class="cta-pill">Projekt anfragen</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="images/hero-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video>
    <div class="overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="#" class="btn-primary">Kostenloses Angebot</a>
        <a href="#" class="btn-ghost">Arbeiten ansehen ↓</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Aus deiner Idee wird ein <span class="hl">echtes Produkt</span>.</h2>
      <p>Apps, Web-Apps und Landingpages — end-to-end gebaut von einem KI-nativen Entwickler, der liefert. Aus Deutschland, weltweit im Einsatz.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="note">Vorschau — Hero zeigt nur noch Video + Buttons; Headline & Text sind jetzt eine eigene helle Sektion darunter.</div>
</body>
</html>
